{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_title", "source_sha256": "cb931f39676376fcbd7a01a9cce75a905e3f8d3002a1a5537d55f04242101ee5", "ja": "ChoruSp@rkle!! DAY1 留守電", "zh": "ChoruSp@rkle!! DAY1 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63685eb4e722ec12aea155dfb227ef945647e6ac635fe84a81293d80c5a1c28f", "ja": "ChoruSp@rkle!! DAY1を無事に終えた\n翼からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是顺利结束ChoruSp@rkle!! DAY1的\n翼留下的留言电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c81e76e58ea6f6c62138bfc1bd260d8e411bed1e658d87f4ec30feca666c2453", "ja": "もしもーし！　{$P$}さん、\nわたしです、翼でーす♪", "zh": "喂——！{$P$}先生，\n是我哦，我是翼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2da1ed921637511ab40718f7011d467bf39d981b7137e5f16809472f4365b560", "ja": "留守電ってことは、やっぱりまだお仕事中？\nまあ明日もありますもんね～。ざーんねん。", "zh": "留言了啊，果然还在工作吗？\n不过明天也还有工作嘛～真遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e0766897bb76337b10df5e3d39ff7aaf51cd13e0666f8adfa6649e6402cd898", "ja": "だって。\n{$P$}さん、わかってますかぁ？", "zh": "因为啊。\n{$P$}先生，您明白吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b05293294deb746c090dfb2d2563329f0037cf586a89873cdfc42c839fda857", "ja": "わたし、今日のライブですっごく頑張ったのに、\nまだ褒めてもらってないんですよ～？", "zh": "我明明在今天的演出上超级努力了，\n却还没得到夸奖呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b849b7aece7fd9d67d34df13f47add6396cb4eaf9815a0378ee8de84ea3a6e8a", "ja": "今日はカッコいい歌とか静かな歌とか……\nわたし、ホントに頑張ったんだもん。", "zh": "今天唱了帅气的歌，还有安静的歌……我真的很努力了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e8eefb4b95ef72a0754ff4c756736143e3fae8c9347268bf56a027d4d539c14", "ja": "ほら、今回はわたし達の成長を見せるんだ～って、\nみんな張り切ってたから……わたしもつられちゃって。", "zh": "你看，这次要展现我们的成长嘛～，\n大家都干劲十足……我也被带动起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f56cd1fc2be16a782a7eb5cbba7c5c29832261e8f3d219aa76517d0363c4f97", "ja": "えへへ、だからその分、いっぱい褒めてくれないと、\nダメですからね～？　えへへ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，所以你得多夸夸我们，才行哦～？嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ddda486b0efbfc0ca6cfa4cb28d54910c60f4bdf343e3c8e0e0f3ed672642447", "ja": "あ、それと！　ご褒美は、\n新作スイーツの食べ歩きで大丈夫でーす♪", "zh": "啊，还有！奖励就定为去吃遍新出的甜点，没问题——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1609f126298f61e5bf90d5f9560784f3cb6718b266490bcf5ac5aa97451b5f7e", "ja": "さて、今日は早く寝て、{$P$}さんと\nご褒美デートしてる夢を見ようっと。", "zh": "那么，今天早点睡，做个和{$P$}先生一起约会吃奖励甜点的梦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_507_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_507_rs_01_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6ffb6cd05d9eb8aa703e0eeff90941e7e9e940ec34780af751fd23edfcc98d86", "ja": "楽しみにしてまーす♪　それじゃ……。\nお休みなさい、{$P$}さん♪　ちゅ☆", "zh": "我很期待哦♪ 那么……晚安，{$P$}先生♪ 啾☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
